1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,241
The decision came between two things the group could not have both of: a metal lock on the canal and a forest that keeps its own timber.

2
00:00:08,241 --> 00:00:20,999
“Someone has to choose,” the activist said, “and the achievement will be small either way.” Rarely had the station been so close to a real question.

3
00:00:20,999 --> 00:00:30,827
The agriculture office wanted a restaurant, a cellar of dairy and beef, and a chain of snack stalls selling goose sausage.

4
00:00:30,827 --> 00:00:41,921
“A darling of a plan,” the chairperson said, “but the forestry figures are not persuasive, and the rainy season is pressing.”

5
00:00:41,921 --> 00:00:47,700
The decision was to dine indoors and to keep the utmost care for the west floor.

6
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:57,463
A cinema, a zoo, and a robotic milking shed were all deferred; the climatic data and the misty mornings mattered more than the dessert.

7
00:00:57,463 --> 00:01:05,982
“Seldom has a project been so unglamorous,” Maya wrote, “and seldom so necessary.”

8
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:18,620
The pressing question was where the money would come from, and the answer was an achievement of a different kind: a maid, a carpenter, and a violinist each donated one day a month.

9
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:25,524
A fable about a victorious goose and a marvelous eraser was printed for the school.

10
00:01:25,524 --> 00:01:37,322
The difficult part was to finalize a plan that reduced the add-on work, cut the center of the old scheme, and dealt with the either-or of agriculture and forestry.

11
00:01:37,322 --> 00:01:43,741
The term began with a full floor of volunteers and less money than the summer.

12
00:01:43,741 --> 00:01:57,014
Within the decision there was a smaller one: to begin with the west bank, to attempt the readings before the deal was signed, and to keep the top of the file blank until the reading arrived.

13
00:01:57,014 --> 00:02:01,624
“We are between two rivers now,” the boatman said.

14
00:02:01,624 --> 00:02:19,776
“That is the only place worth standing.” The difficulty of the decision was either small or total: the floor of the cellar, the west room, and the center of the town all needed less, and the term would begin with a full set of reduced plans.

15
00:02:19,776 --> 00:02:25,760
The scene at the restaurant was less dramatic than the fable, and more useful.

16
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:30,589
A summer of readings had reduced the argument to one page.

17
00:02:30,589 --> 00:02:44,120
A chopstick, a plate of meat, and an idiomatic phrase borrowed from the zoology department: doubtless the smaller accomplishment was to add nothing to the menu.
